            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "House resolved itself into the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union pursuant to H. Res. 951 and Rule XVIII.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H32400",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-18",
            "actionTime": "09:20:23",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "The Speaker designated the Honorable Carol D. Miller to act as Chairwoman of the Committee.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-18",
            "actionTime": "09:20:08",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632 and H.R. 4371. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, under a structured rule and H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632, and H.R. 4371 under a closed rule. The resolution provides one motion to recommit on each bill.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H30000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-18",
            "actionTime": "09:20:03",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 951. (consideration: CR H6029-6044)",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H1L210",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-16",
            "actionTime": "09:59:03",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 951 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632 and H.R. 4371. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, under a structured rule and H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632, and H.R. 4371 under a closed rule. The resolution provides one motion to recommit on each bill.",
            "type": "Floor"
